{
	"id": "wdh",
	"name": "wdh",
	"title": "Waterdeep: Dragon Heist",
	"description": "<p><strong>A Treasure Hunting Adventure for Levels 1-5</strong></p>\r\n<p>Take a mad romp through the wards of Waterdeep as you uncover a villainous plot involving some of the city&rsquo;s most influential figures. A grand urban caper awaits you. Pit your skill and bravado against villains the likes of which you&rsquo;ve never faced before, and let the dragon hunt begin!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Add <strong>59 forgotten monsters</strong> to use in the Encounter Builder to create &amp; run organized battles for your party<br />&bull;&nbsp;Steal <strong>12 new magical items</strong> and discover what they do with a click of your character sheet<br />&bull;&nbsp;Play <strong>a unique game each time you play</strong> --the game&rsquo;s villains and story change with each session<br />&bull;&nbsp;<strong>Rollable tables</strong>, <strong>detailed maps</strong>, and <strong>a wealth of stats</strong> to help dungeon masters run this <strong>256-page adventure</strong></p>\r\n<p>More&nbsp;in the&nbsp;Forgotten Realms:<br />- <span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/tashas-cauldron-of-everything?icid_medium=crosspromo\">Tasha's Cauldron of Everything</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/icewind-dale-rime-of-the-frostmaiden?icid_source=wdhmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=iwd\">Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden</a></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/baldurs-gate-descent-into-avernus?icid_source=wdhmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=bgdia\">Baldur&rsquo;s Gate: Descent into Avernus</a></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/sword-coast-adventurers-guide?icid_source=wdhmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=scag\">Sword Coast Adventurer's Guide</a></span></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>This purchase unlocks the contents of this adventure for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium&nbsp;and access options from the book in the searchable listings, character builder, and digital sheet.</p>",
